  "markdown": "The Wallcovering Guide · Choose and source\n\n# York Wallcoverings\n\nYork Wallcoverings describes a Pennsylvania manufacturing history and a catalogue of printed and natural wallcoverings. It shares York Design Group with Brewster Home Fashions. Its own online shipping policy excludes destinations outside the United States.\n\n## Source evidence\n\nRead the maker’s information for the selected product and destination. A brand profile does not certify a seller or prove that an order will be accepted.\n\n- [Official source](https://yorkwallcoverings.com/pages/about) — checked 2026-10-17\n- [Official source](https://yorkdesigngroup.com/pages/about-us) — checked 2026-10-17\n- [Official source](https://yorkwallcoverings.com/) — checked 2026-10-17\n- [Official source](https://yorkwallcoverings.com/policies/shipping-policy) — checked 2026-10-17\n\n[Visit maker website](https://yorkwallcoverings.com/)\n\n## Official sourcing routes\n\nCheck the route’s scope before ordering. Showrooms, samples and finder links do not establish a roll checkout or delivery promise.\n\n### Shop or product ordering\n\nBrowse products and order through the official website.\n\n**Region**\n: United States\n\n**UK access**\n: Not a UK delivery route.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: Not established; ask the maker about the selected destination.\n\nMaker-published information; confirm current eligibility and destination before ordering.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nCheckout/account requirements not established; ask the maker Most residential patterns have samples for online purchase, per FAQ\n\nOfficial page checked 2026-10-17. Website evidence, not a test order.\n\n[Open official source](https://yorkwallcoverings.com/)\n\n### Find a stockist or representative\n\nOpen York’s official finder page. Check the country selection. Individual sellers and UK availability have not been verified.\n\n**Region**\n: Locator geography not verified\n\n**UK access**\n: No UK listing or UK stockholding verified.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: Not established; ask the maker about the selected destination.\n\nOfficial link only; individual results and purchasing terms are not verified.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nOfficial finder link only; no seller, purchase eligibility, sample or delivery terms are endorsed.\n\nOfficial page checked 2026-10-18. Website evidence, not a test order.\n\n[Open official source](https://yorkwallcoverings.com/pages/store-locator)\n\n[All makers](https://www.mrwallcover.com/makers/)\n\n## From sample to specification\n\nRecord the exact design and product code, check current instructions and establish the wall preparation before quantities and installation are agreed.\n\n[Discuss your wallcovering](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/?intent=source)\n\nBy [Dorin Burcus](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/#dorin), founder · Last updated 18 October 2026\n",
